  "title": "Avery Dennison announces strategic $75 million investment in Wiliot to scale physical AI | Avery Dennison",
  "summary": "Avery Dennison Corporation (NYSE:AVY), a leading global materials science and digital identification solutions company, today announced a $75 million minority investment in Wiliot, a global leader in Physical AI for supply chains. This strategic investment deepens the long-standing partnership dedicated to creating a more intelligent, transparent and connected world.",
